      "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "Removed layer/AF/cast values (old 0\u20138) \u2014 orthogonal accounting dimensions, not causes; recoverable from companion IEs; eliminates double-counting Renumbered enum to causal classes only: errors = 0 \u2026 no-buffer = 29 Added unknown = 255 for unclassified discards\r\nRewrote design principle 2: causes-only scope; values mutually exclusive by construction Specificity: fall back to nearest causal aggregate; unknown only when causal category unknown; no layer-only values by design Multiplicity: MUST \u2192 SHOULD for one-record-per-reason; single-reason exporters report dominant reason or common aggregate Exporters MUST include flowDirection (or equivalent) \u2014 parent IM flow structure is direction-keyed Biflow note: reversibility doesn't identify which direction dropped; prefer uniflow records Collectors MUST resolve hierarchy via registry Name paths, not numeric ranges Range: 0..38 \u2192 0..255, assigned values delegated to subregistry IANA expert guidance: append from lowest unassigned; preorder not preserved across additions Parent reference: discardmodel-10 \u2192 -14; enum re-verified against -14 Added [IANA-IPFIX] informative reference\r\nAppendix A: SQL restored to fenced sourcecode blocks; no-buffer 38 \u2192 29 \u00a72: duplicated intent-for-policy text replaced with pointer to parent \u00a76.1",
